  "contentHtml": "<DIV>\r\n<DIV style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(254,222,199); PADDING-LEFT: 10px; PADDING-RIGHT: 10px; BORDER-TOP: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; PADDING-TOP: 10px\" class=txc-textbox>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.2px\"><FONT size=3><SPAN style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 25.6px; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</SPAN></FONT></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.2px\"><FONT size=3><SPAN style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 25.6px; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</SPAN></FONT></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.2px\"><B><SPAN style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6; FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</SPAN></SPAN></B></P></DIV>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">준비물 : 500ml페트병, 송곳, 가위. 클레이, 굵은 빨대, 굵은 빨대 보다 조금 가느다란 빨대</SPAN></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">제작법 : 1. 페트병 뚜껑에 송곳으로 구멍을 뚫고 가느다란 빨대를 꽂는다.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">(구멍이 커지면 클레이로 잘 막아준다.)</SPAN></P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2. 굵은 빨대 끝에 클레이를 붙인다. 각자 알아서 꾸미기를 한다.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3. 굵은 빨대를 가느다란 빨대에 끼우고 페트병을 눌러서 쏘아본다.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 4. 과녘을 그려서 맞추기를 해본다</SPAN>.</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/222EC44C561DEEE124\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"20151014_120848.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"320\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"320\"  id=\"A_222EC44C561DEEE1248875\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/27749E4B561DEE0326\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"20151014_094946.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"580\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"580\"  id=\"A_27749E4B561DEE0326535B\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2579DD4B561DEE0620\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"20151014_095207.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"580\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"580\"  id=\"A_2579DD4B561DEE06209285\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">귀여운 탄두</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/211D5A34561E0BED0E\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"20151014_161154.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"400\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"400\"  id=\"A_211D5A34561E0BED0ECAB9\"/></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</P></DIV>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
